            "review_title": "Review at Golden Time Hotel Restaurant",
            "review_text": "52Ian47\nAnglesea, Australia34 contributions\n0\nGreat Value for money\nMar 2016 • Solo\nI booked this hotel on the reports I read on computer sites. It was cheap but the reports all seem to read well. It was also in an area just walking distance from the main shopping and entertanment area. On arrival I was shown to my room, a good size room with mountain views. It was clean and the bathroom was in good condition and clean. The next morning I went down to the \"m\" floor to a well laid out breakfast with a great selection of food. My 4 days here left me knowing that on my return I would book here again.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 17, 2016",
